{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JAIL COLLEGE</strong> is an adult visual novel combining steamy storytelling, engaging trivia, and player-driven choices.<br>You play as<strong>\u00a0</strong>an honest man sent to prison after stealing food to save his starving family. When offered a chance to join an experimental university program inside the prison walls, he must study, answer trivia questions, and earn his degree\u2026 while charming a cast of beautiful and seductive hot woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your knowledge is your key to freedom \u2014 and to unlocking erotic rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf93 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <i>Adult visual novel</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <i>Trivia gameplay</i> \u2014 answer general knowledge quizzes to progress and unlock steamy scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8b <i>Seductive cast</i> \u2014 professors, social workers, and prison staff, each with unique personalities and stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <i>Anime-inspired art</i> \u2014 colorful anime style artworks\u00a0to deliver a vibrant, comic-like anime atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <i>Made in Ren'Py</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to study hard, play smart, and charm your way to freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Few info about the characters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832250/extras/19efdb3d8d749982fb1f816188e4efac.avif?t=1762247291\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcda Alma Hayduk</strong><br>A former bestselling romance author turned Spanish Literature professor. Alma teaches with passion, elegance, and a sensual charm that makes every lesson feel like forbidden poetry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832250/extras/8213fadd34b9c36163ffbe5a3fa1a18e.avif?t=1762247291\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc51 Director Anjeleena Steel</strong><br>The ruthless Ice Queen. A prison warden with iron discipline and a dark secret desire\u2014only the right man can shatter her cold control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832250/extras/3074e51dcfb4e8ed89b175d2cbd41809.avif?t=1762247291\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcd6 Charlene Furiosa</strong><br>An authority on ancient history\u2026 and ancient lusts. Behind her marble mask lies a dominatrix of the mind, eager to test the limits of knowledge and desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832250/extras/55debdc2fa462a23fbfbc1b324bc470b.avif?t=1762247291\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Haley Blazy</strong><br>Ex-Olympian, now coach of body and willpower. Her lessons are sweat, discipline, and temptation\u2014every challenge a dangerous game of endurance and desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832250/extras/3ece546d945b188a0bdbfeba7d434f83.avif?t=1762247291\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Heather Adams</strong><br>The heart of the prison project. Warm, intelligent, and endlessly empathetic\u2014yet her guidance hides a subtle, irresistible game of temptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832250/extras/638bffb1576bc26fe0200508e6616a32.avif?t=1762247291\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Isabella Bellezza</strong><br>A philosopher of beauty and desire. Enigmatic, magnetic, almost sacred\u2014her gaze alone is a lesson in art, eros, and eternal mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832250/extras/4f359013e41dc72b871920b700d2f2d1.avif?t=1762247291\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc83 Jennifer Ramirez</strong><br>The fiery Latin MILF. Professor of Music and Dance, she teaches with rhythm, laughter, and unapologetic sensuality\u2014every step a seduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832250/extras/65654825031d22a9ffd4ade631d6c15e.avif?t=1762247291\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcda Juleea Rubin</strong><br>The Gothic muse. Refined, theatrical, and secretly burning for forbidden passion\u2014every lesson feels like a dark, romantic play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832250/extras/95fb6e772f1ab9c3c820655bb9926ffc.avif?t=1762247291\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><str